cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the companion paper (see preferred-citation)."
title: "ARnetwork: Atmospheric River Transport Networks"
abstract: >-
  Codebase for constructing, analyzing, and visualizing Atmospheric River
  Transport Networks (ARTNs) as directed, weighted graphs derived from the
  PIKART catalog and ERA5 reanalysis. Includes pipelines for network
  construction on an H3 hexagonal grid, topological and dynamical analysis,
  and visualization of global AR transport patterns.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Braun
    given-names: Tobias
    affiliation: "Leipzig University; Potsdam Institute for Climate Impact Research (PIK)"
